letter.body:
The Secretary of State of the State of Arden certifies that Articles of Organization for {{entity_name}} were filed on {{date}} and that it is organized as a limited liability company under the laws of Arden.

Entity number: {{number}}
Management: {{management}}
Registered agent: {{agent_name}}, {{agent_address}}
Principal office: {{principal_address}}

An annual report is due every year by the last day of the month in which the company was formed. A report filed late is charged a $50.00 late fee, and a company that has not filed 60 days after its due date is administratively dissolved.

You will need the entity number to apply for tax accounts and licenses.

The Secretary of State of the State of Arden certifies that Articles of Incorporation for {{entity_name}} were filed on {{date}}.

Entity number: {{number}}
Authorized shares: {{shares}}
Registered agent: {{agent_name}}, {{agent_address}}

An annual report is due every year by the last day of the anniversary month of incorporation.
